            "Curve Type": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "rich": {
      "why": "Negative gamma 0.6 (long latitude), print gamma 2.8 with D max 3.2 so blacks sit near code 13, a slight fade, and whites roll off near 203. Chosen offline for mid contrast about 1.15 for Ryan's 'richness, a deepness, a little bit of the fade'.",
      "stages": [
