    "rich-halation": {
      "why": "rich plus Halation on the negative side, reflection 5 stops down (default 3) to keep glow low. A second Clamp 0+ follows Halation: without it, saturated teal went negative after the red-shift matrix and the negative Film Curve logged it into speckles (872 speckle pixels on IMG_0006's bowl vs 0 without halation, 2026-09-12).",
