      "why": "flc-clean-restrained plus CineFocus, Resolve's depth-map defocus. An action cam's tiny sensor and 155-degree lens give near-infinite depth of field, which reads 'action cam' whatever the colour does; separating a subject from its background is an OPTICAL lever, not a colour one. Aperture and focus distance are CHOSEN.",
